  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Financing Fund Vocational Training (Challenge Fund)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="DE">Finanzierungsfonds Berufsbildung (Challlenge Fund)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="DE">Der Kosovo Challenge Fund (KCF) st&#xe4;rt die Besch&#xe4;ftigungsf&#xe4;higeit junger Menschen und verbessert die Wettbeerbsf&#xe4;higeit von Unternehmen im Kosovo. Es ist ein einzigartiges Instrument f&#xfc;r die bedarfsorientierte Finanzierung von Programmen der ooperativen Berufsbildung mit einem hohen Anteil an pratischer Ausbildung in Unternehmen. Konsortien, die aus &#xf6;ffentlichen und/oder privaten Berufsschulen und mindestens zei Unternehmen bestehen, &#xf6;nnen in einem Wettbeerb eine KCF-Finanzierung beantragen, um moderne Trainingsprogramme in den beteiligten Berufsbildungseinrichtungen zu finanzieren. Das Vorhaben steht allen Branchen offen und f&#xf6;rdert die Gleichstellung der Geschlechter, gr&#xfc;ne Kompetenzen und regionale Integration. Finanziert ird in erster Linie relevante Ausstattung und Beratungsleistungen. Dar&#xfc;ber hinaus erden regionaler Austausch, politischer Dialog und Lernformate organisiert, um die Sichtbareit und das Kno-ho arbeitsplatzbasierter Ausbildung im Kosovo zu erh&#xf6;hen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Kosovo Challenge Fund (KCF) strengthens the employability of young people and enhances the competitiveness of companies in Kosovo. It is a unique instrument for the demand-oriented financing of cooperative vocational education and training (VET) programs ith a high proportion of or-based training. Through a competitive process, consortia made up of public and/or private vocational schools and a minimum of to companies, can apply for KCF funding to finance modern VET infrastructure at the partnering VET institutes. The project is open to all sectors and promotes gender equality, green sills, and regional integration. Funding is provided for infrastructure and consultancy relevant to the training programs. Further, regional exchange, political dialogue and learning formats are organised, aiming at increasing the visibility and no-ho of cooperative education in Kosovo.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Kosovo Challenge Fund (KCF) strengthens the employability of young people and enhances the competitiveness of companies in Kosovo. It is a unique instrument for the demand-oriented financing of cooperative vocational education and training (VET) programs ith a high proportion of or-based training. Through a competitive process, consortia made up of public and/or private vocational schools and a minimum of to companies, can apply for KCF funding to finance modern VET infrastructure at the partnering VET institutes. The project is open to all sectors and promotes gender equality, green sills, and regional integration. Funding is provided for infrastructure and consultancy relevant to the training programs. Further, regional exchange, political dialogue and learning formats are organised, aiming at increasing the visibility and no-ho of cooperative education in Kosovo.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="DE">Verbesserung der beruflichen Aus- und Weiterbildungsm&#xf6;glicheiten &#xfc;ber anreizbasierte Finanzierungsangebote</narrative>
  </description>
